# Hook registry. Every hook the module installs must be listed here, one per line:
#   <kind> <target>
# kind: jni (RegisterNatives replacement) | plt (import of a named caller library)
# tests/hook_registry_test.py fails when an entry is outside the allow list or names a drawing,
# paint, layout or canvas symbol, and when the sources hook a class the registry does not name.
jni android/graphics/fonts/Font$Builder.nBuild
